.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# === Root Obsidian config (the vault at .obsidian-vault/ carries its own) ===
/.obsidian/

# === Superseded decisions: audit trail, kept and committed, never deleted ===
# These stay tracked on purpose - they are the record of what was decided and why.
# This line only stops the DEFAULT ripgrep walk returning them, so a keyword search
# ranks a current document instead of a 91 KB archived handoff. git status stays
# clean because tracked files are unaffected by gitignore. To read one anyway:
# open it by path, use git grep, or rg --no-ignore. See AGENTS.md "Docs and the board".
docs/archive/

# === Local pre-edit backups (kept on disk for rollback, never committed) ===
*.bak
*.bak.*
